Regenerate the PyYAML-oracle tests (run from this directory):
  python3 yamlcases.py canon.clay > ../yaml_cases_test.clay
  python3 yamlsamples.py canon.clay > ../yaml_samples_test.clay
PyYAML is YAML 1.1: cases where 1.1 and 1.2 differ (0o17, +.5, yes/no, tabs) are
tested by hand in ../yaml_test.clay instead.
